      "description": "A scene composed of an elderly man with a turban and overlaid text that promotes violence and scapegoats a government, creating a false association between the man's peaceful appearance and the hateful message. The scene is designed to incite hatred or fear toward a specific group (implied to be Muslim immigrants or refugees) by juxtaposing a benign visual with a violent message.",
