      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "religious_stereotype",
      "label": "Religious Stereotype",
      "description": "The image of a man wearing a turban, combined with the violent text, implicitly references the stereotype that religious attire (like turbans) signifies extremism or barbarism. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is necessary to understand the meme's intent to associate the man's appearance with violence.",
